      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Between 1.7. 1988-31. 12. 1989 in 18 surgical departments of the former GDR 6, 266 patients suffering from \"appendicitis\" were registered and qualitatively evaluated. The perforation rate was 8.3%. 30% of these patients had no typical diagnosis. Postoperative lethality was 0.32%."},
